@host = https://localhost:5001
@entraAccessToken = paste-entra-access-token-here

### Get an internal test token
POST {{host}}/auth/internal-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "internal-worker",
  "clientSecret": "local-dev-secret"
}

### Internal-only endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/internal-report
Authorization: Bearer paste-internal-token-here

### Entra-only endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/spa-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{entraAccessToken}}
